<s-1 id="RM00000224D000X_01_0023" proc-id="E0505_____000004L00000">
<ptxt>Inspect Connecting Rod Bolt</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Using vernier calipers, measure the diameter within the range shown in the illustration.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A036651J01" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<subtitle>Standard</subtitle>
<specitem>
<ptxt>7.2-7.3mm</ptxt>
</specitem>
<subtitle>Limit</subtitle>
<specitem>
<ptxt>7.0mm</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Measure the diameter at several positions.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If the diameter is less than the minimum, always replace the connecting rod bolt with a new one, as the engine may be damaged.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If the bolt threads are damaged, replace the connecting rod bolt. </ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
