<s-1 id="RM00000224D000X_01_0025" proc-id="E0505_____000004N00000">
<ptxt>Inspect Crankshaft Bearing Cap Set Bolt</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Using vernier calipers, measure the diameter within the range shown in the illustration.</ptxt>
