<graphic graphicname="A064458J01" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<subtitle>Standard</subtitle>
<specitem>
<ptxt>7.3-7.5mm</ptxt>
</specitem>
<subtitle>Limit</subtitle>
<specitem>
<ptxt>7.2mm</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Measure the diameter at several positions.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If the diameter is less than the minimum, always replace the crankshaft bearing cap bolt with a new one, as the engine may be damaged.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If the bolt threads are damaged, replace the crankshaft bearing cap bolt. </ptxt>
